---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Rust Streams & Client"
  description="Native Rust Kafka client (krabka-client-rs) and async stream processing runtime (krabka-streams-rs)."
  currentSlug="/docs/streams-rs"
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">Rust Streams & Client</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2 text-base">
        High-performance async streaming built on Tokio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
      <p>
        The Rust client ecosystem consists of <code class="font-mono text-krab-300">krabka-client-rs</code> (providing <code class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-200">FutureProducer</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-200">StreamConsumer</code>, and <code class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-200">AdminClient</code>) and <code class="font-mono text-krab-300">krabka-streams-rs</code> (providing stateful streaming topologies, windowing, and schema registry serdes).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
